Suggested Fix (optional)

When “Reset App State” is clicked, update the product buttons from the same cart state that gets cleared, so they show “Add to cart” again.
Apply the same reset to the button on the product detail page.

Acceptance Criteria

 Given products have been added to the cart, when the user clicks “Reset App State”, then every “Remove” button on the Products page changes back to “Add to cart” without a page reload.
 Given “Reset App State” has been clicked, when the user looks at the cart icon, then no badge is shown.
 Given “Reset App State” has been clicked, when the user opens a product detail page, then its button shows “Add to cart”.
 Given “Reset App State” has been clicked, when the user clicks “Add to cart” on any product, then the item is added and the badge shows 1.
 Adding and removing items without using “Reset App State” still works as before.
